          "content": "@echo off\ntitle SnipLink + AI Security Engine\ncolor 0b\n\necho.\necho  ==============================================================\necho          SNIPLINK URL SHORTENER + AI SECURITY ENGINE\necho  ==============================================================\necho.\n\n:: Paths\nset \"NODE_APP=d:\\Projects\\URL Shortner\"\nset \"AI_APP=d:\\Projects\\AI based phishing url detector\"\n\n:: Step 1: Kill old processes\necho  [1/5] Stopping any running instances...\ntaskkill /F /IM node.exe /T >nul 2>&1\ntimeout /t 1 /nobreak >nul\n\n:: Step 2: Install Node dependencies if missing\necho  [2/5] Checking Node.js dependencies...\ncd /d \"%NODE_APP%\"\nif not exist \"node_modules\\express\" (\n    echo        Installing dependencies...\n    call npm install --quiet 2>nul\n    if errorlevel 1 (\n        echo  [ERROR] npm install failed. Make sure Node.js is installed.\n        pause\n        exit /b 1\n    )\n)\necho        Dependencies OK.\n\n:: Step 3: Check Python\necho  [3/5] Checking Python environment...\npython --version >nul 2>&1\nif errorlevel 1 (\n    echo  [WARN] Python not found. AI Security Engine will be unavailable.\n    echo         Install Python from python.org to enable security scanning.\n    goto :start_node_only\n)\n\n:: Step 4: Start both servers\necho  [4/5] Starting servers...\n\n:: Start Node.js URL Shortener (port 3000)\necho        Starting SnipLink Backend...\nstart \"\" /min cmd /c \"cd /d \"%NODE_APP%\" && node server.js\"\n\n:: Start Python AI Detector (port 8000)\necho        Starting AI Security Engine...\ncd /d \"%AI_APP%\"\nif exist \"requirements.txt\" (\n    pip install -r requirements.txt --quiet --user >nul 2>&1\n)\nstart \"\" /min cmd /c \"cd /d \"%AI_APP%\" && python run.py\"\n\ngoto :done\n\n:start_node_only\necho  [4/5] Starting Node.js server only...\nstart \"\" /min cmd /c \"cd /d \"%NODE_APP%\" && node server.js\"\n\n:done\necho  [5/5] Waiting for servers to start...\ntimeout /t 4 /nobreak >nul\n\necho.\necho  ==============================================================\necho   All systems launched!\necho.\necho   URL Shortener:  http://localhost:3000\necho   AI Security:    http://localhost:8000\necho  ==============================================================\necho.\n\n:: Open browser\nstart http://localhost:3000\n\necho  Press any key to close this window. Servers keep running.\npause >nul\nexit\n"
